## Authorised task

The user requested creating the combined backbone-H1 figure. Produce Figure 1(a), the whole-network backbone at alpha = 0.20, beside Figure 1(b), the selected all-eligible-transfers H1 permutation plot. Use saved restricted-period evidence only, in a fresh-context agent. No new permutation, community detection, force layout, R parity run or statistical analysis is authorised. Do not overwrite the saved source figures. H2 Figure 2 is already selected and H2b is omitted from the manuscript.

## Sources and definitions

Both panels originate from the same 16,636 eligible transfer records involving 4,602 players in recorded source seasons 2012/13-2024/25. H1 uses every eligible event; the backbone is a filtered view of their club-pair aggregation.

- Backbone: [route scores](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/louvain_transfer_backbone_findings/backbone_route_scores.csv), [fixed layout](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/louvain_transfer_backbone_findings/backbone_layout.csv), [retention](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/louvain_transfer_backbone_findings/backbone_retention.csv) and [summary](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/louvain_transfer_backbone_findings/backbone_summary.md), scope `whole`, strict endpoint score below 0.20. Preserve the original structural-exception rule (zero eligible exceptions in the whole network), positions and sizes, weighted directed arrows and [saved Louvain membership/colours](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/louvain_transfer_communities_findings/communities.csv). Expected: 383 active clubs, 1,396 routes and 5,271 transfers (31.7% of sample volume). Communities pool ages and include non-PL destinations.
- H1: [results JSON](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/age_shuffle_outsideprem_toprem_results.json), `all_eligible_transfers`, including 999 saved simulated gaps, and [summary](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/age_shuffle_outsideprem_toprem_summary.md). Preserve the [existing plot](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/age_shuffle_outsideprem_toprem_findings/age_shuffle_outsideprem_toprem_all_eligible_transfers.pdf) conventions. Older rate 129/1,063 = 12.14%; younger 2,267/15,573 = 14.56%; older-minus-younger gap -2.42 percentage points. Mean shuffled gap -1.31, one SD 0.83, empirical lower-tail p = 0.098. Shuffles preserve origin-club/season age counts; the normal curve is illustrative. The fixed-player sensitivity remains Results prose.

## Presentation and verification

Follow [PLOTTING_STYLE.md](../../PLOTTING_STYLE.md), with PNAS full width 17.8 cm. Use embedded Arial and print-readable panel titles, labels and legends. Do not confuse backbone community colours with age or observed/null encodings. Export the combined two-panel figure and both standalone panels as PDF, 600 dpi PNG and editable-text SVG in a new [backbone-H1 folder](../../output/backbone_h1_findings/), using a new [producer](../../notebooks/plot_backbone_h1_figure.py). Include README sources/caption/reproduction and verification evidence. Proposed parent label remains `fig:entry-age`.

Check source hashes, counts, retained weights and H1 values, preserving source/historical PDF hashes. Inspect the actual combined and standalone PDFs at final physical size in colour and grayscale, including arrows, legends and text. Verify dimensions, embedded fonts, vector graphics, zero rotation, PNG resolution and editable SVG text. Any final fit to the paper's 0.50-page placeholder must be established separately by caption-inclusive typesetting; no silent budget reallocation.

